# The topics net.goath1.com's broker carries: the game's, and nothing else
# (installed as /etc/mosquitto/goath1.acl). These lines, before any "user"
# line, are the anonymous clients'; everything else, "#" and $SYS included,
# is refused. Each part after hceu/3/ is a hash in hex.
#
# signalling (the host's and the joiner's topics of an invite) and parties
# (p2p_signal.c, p2p_party.c): hceu/3/<HMAC>
topic readwrite hceu/3/+
# friends' inboxes and presence (p2p_friends.c): hceu/3/f/<HMAC>
topic readwrite hceu/3/f/+
# the server browser (p2p_lobby.c): each host's slot (its retained listing,
# and the will that clears it), which browsers subscribe to as
# hceu/3/lobby/s/+, and the browsers' queries
topic readwrite hceu/3/lobby/s/+
topic readwrite hceu/3/lobby/q
